    "\n",
    "1. **Distance-to-stroke** preprocessing.\n",
    "2. **Local-density blur** preprocessing.\n",
    "\n",
    "Both CNNs use the same synthetic training/test data, architecture, batch size, learning rate, loss, confidence threshold and **15 training epochs**. The synthetic-data generator is retained unchanged from the source notebook.\n",
