    "Evaluation outputs are shown directly in the notebook and are also exported. These include:\n",
    "\n",
    "- pixel-level precision, recall, F1-score, accuracy and IoU;\n",
    "- confusion matrices for both methods;\n",
    "- engineering-vector comparison metrics;\n",
    "- compact visual comparisons of the target and both CNN predictions.\n",
